  characterData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7d0e694a6a7919c47b9de361066c4730, type: 2}
  Dialog: "I question everything happening to me right now, but suddenly there's
    a flurry of footsteps right outside my door, snapping me out of my thoughts.
    As curiosity wins over me, I get out of the room following where everybody went
    and outside of a particular room I see a crowd gathering around something. As
    I make my way to the crowd, I hear whispers and as I get closer I see an unbelievable
    sight, a woman clad in a maid\u2019s uniform lying lifelessly on the floor, she
    looks to be in her late 30s. A frightened maid who I presumed to be the one who
    screamed earlier, is sitting on the floor in shock"
